###  http://example.com#ImputeMissingvalues
:ImputeMissingvalues rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Event ,
                                     [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                       owl:onProperty [ owl:inverseOf gufo:isEventProperPartOf
                                                      ] ;
